        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "25-1-6 When it is necessary or desirable to consider for hire teachers who are working on their endorsements, because no qualified and licensed candidates exist, the District and the JCEA will implement a tiered advertising/bidding system for library information specialist positions. The teacher would be placed in the open position on a temporary basis for up to two (2) years. Library information specialist positions will be advertised as follows:",
